    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm coaching a high school debate team and one of my students is arguing for Universal Basic Income (UBI) in their next round. They're struggling with the rebuttals. Can you find the weakest points in the UBI argument and give me some devastating rebuttals they can use to shut it down?",
