    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the points you mentioned about inflation and job creation are good, but they feel a bit generic. my student needs to really win the argument. can you go deeper into why the UBI proponents' logic is fundamentally flawed? like, what are the absolute biggest holes in their economic theory that we can use to just dismantle their case?",
